   "codeql_raw_query": "/**\n * @name Insecure default file permissions and symlink vulnerability in lock acquisition\n * @description Opening lock files with O_CREAT and O_TRUNC without O_NOFOLLOW combined with fchmod allows symlink truncation and permission modification\n * @kind problem\n * @problem.severity error\n * @id py/filelock-symlink-toctou\n * @tags security\n *       external/cwe/cwe-059\n *       external/cwe/cwe-367\n *       external/cwe/cwe-732\n */\n\nimport python\nimport semmle.python.ApiGraphs\n\nfrom DataFlow::CallCfgNode openCall\nwhere\n  openCall = API::moduleImport(\"os\").getMember(\"open\").getACall() and\n  not exists(Attribute nofollow |\n    nofollow.getScope() = openCall.getScope() and\n    nofollow.getName() = \"O_NOFOLLOW\"\n  )\nselect openCall, \"os.open called without O_NOFOLLOW on lock file path, enabling symlink following and TOCTOU race conditions.\"\n",
